00:09:42.875 --> 00:09:45.086
You should just die.

00:09:47.379 --> 00:09:50.257
What did I ever do to you people?

00:09:50.508 --> 00:09:52.593
I can't think of a single thing...

00:09:52.843 --> 00:09:55.304
But it doesn't matter.

00:09:55.554 --> 00:09:57.431
None of this matters.

00:09:58.682 --> 00:10:02.686
It's complete. You finally changed.

00:10:02.937 --> 00:10:05.064
You were a lot like me,

00:10:05.314 --> 00:10:09.485
