00:10:40.850 --> 00:10:42.601
Remember, Shigeo.

00:10:42.852 --> 00:10:45.104
Reigen and I are waiting for you outside!

00:10:45.354 --> 00:10:48.566
Rei... gen? Who's that?

00:10:52.611 --> 00:10:55.573
Oh, hey, Mob. Sorry, but could
you hurry to the office?

00:10:55.823 --> 00:10:57.533
A huge job just came in.

00:10:57.783 --> 00:11:00.411
Your master needs your help,
so you better hurry it up.

00:11:00.661 --> 00:11:02.413
Mas... ter?

00:11:02.663 --> 00:11:05.666
Stop using your powers for
dumb things in this dumb world.

00:11:05.916 --> 00:11:08.878
Don't you want to be a big brother
