more thankful to everyone around me

00:12:45.975 --> 00:12:47.977
once I get back to the real world.

00:12:48.227 --> 00:12:51.647
So that's how it's going to be?

00:12:51.897 --> 00:12:56.360
And here I thought I'd found
a sympathizer. How disappointing.

00:12:56.610 --> 00:12:58.362
One other thing.

00:12:58.612 --> 00:13:02.449
People can change through
their interactions with others.

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:05.494
I was able to change because of everyone.

00:13:05.744 --> 00:13:09.915
I was able to become a little stronger
than if I had been alone.

00:13:10.165 --> 00:13:13.877
If I'm able to change, then everyone
else should be able to as well.

00:13:14.128 --> 00:13:16.797
That means no one is worthless.

00:13:17.047 --> 00:13:19.091
Don't say another word...

00:13:19.341 --> 00:13:21.552
Or you'll have hell to pay.

00:13:21.802 --> 00:13:25.848
The Shigeo you fabricated might
succumb to you, but I won't.

00:13:26.098 --> 00:13:27.433
