00:13:36.483 --> 00:13:39.945
"Mob Psycho 100 II"

00:13:40.237 --> 00:13:43.699
"Mob Psycho 100 II"

00:13:49.663 --> 00:13:51.498
A spiritual mutation?

00:13:51.749 --> 00:13:54.752
Guess we're gonna have to fight!
