00:14:04.011 --> 00:14:06.388
Every inhabitant of this world is...

00:14:12.436 --> 00:14:13.479
Shigeo!

00:14:24.948 --> 00:14:26.241
That's...

00:14:31.038 --> 00:14:34.208
I'm going to defeat this evil spirit
and go back to reality.

00:14:34.458 --> 00:14:36.043
And what good would that do?

00:14:36.293 --> 00:14:39.088
The life you lead won't change,
and nor will society's absurdities.

00:14:39.338 --> 00:14:43.384
There will be plenty of things
to annoy and trouble you.

00:14:43.634 --> 00:14:46.136
The outside world is... scary?

00:14:47.346 --> 00:14:53.477
Life is frustrating, devoid of meaning,
and so, so painful.

00:14:53.727 --> 00:14:55.187
I can hear them...

00:14:55.437 --> 00:14:59.024
The voices of the dead
are speaking to me.

00:14:59.274 --> 00:15:01.443
So many screams...

00:15:01.693 --> 00:15:04.530
They died feeling like this?

00:15:04.780 --> 00:15:07.408
Is this how they felt when they were alive?

00:15:07.658 --> 00:15:10.953
It's such a cruel world...

00:15:11.203 --> 00:15:13.330
Am I really going to be able to...

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:14.748
...me...

00:15:14.998 --> 00:15:15.874
That voice!

00:15:16.125 --> 00:15:17.751
Help me...

00:15:18.001 --> 00:15:20.921
Oh... That's right.

00:15:21.171 --> 00:15:24.299
I came here to save someone.

00:15:28.345 --> 00:15:32.391
I always thought these powers
were of no use to anybody...

00:15:33.434 --> 00:15:35.018
...but I'll use them to save people!

00:15:36.311 --> 00:15:40.649
It doesn't matter what you do.
You cannot defeat me!

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:56.832
Shigeo... you did it.

00:15:57.082 --> 00:15:58.542
Well, I'll be damned.

00:16:03.505 --> 00:16:06.675
You're not the same boy from earlier.

00:16:06.925 --> 00:16:10.429
Who are you?

00:16:10.679 --> 00:16:13.056
You finally get how freaky he is?

00:16:13.307 --> 00:16:17.102
This is Kageyama Shigeo's true form
that he reveals when he's pissed--

00:16:17.352 --> 00:16:19.188
Dimple.

00:16:19.438 --> 00:16:23.275
It's dangerous, so leave
this to me and stay back.

00:16:23.525 --> 00:16:25.360
Actually, yeah, who are you?

00:16:28.572 --> 00:16:33.035
Mogami had overlooked something
that lay dormant within Mob.

00:16:33.285 --> 00:16:35.412
A person's heart is made up
of two sides of the same coin.

00:16:35.662 --> 00:16:38.415
Just as happiness shines
in the shadows of sorrow,

00:16:38.665 --> 00:16:41.502
only in the darkest depths of fear

00:16:41.752 --> 00:16:43.253
does courage truly shine.

00:17:09.238 --> 00:17:14.535
The powerful blast from
Mob's positive emotions at 100%

00:17:14.785 --> 00:17:18.205
annihilated the great evil spirit, Mogami.

00:17:19.248 --> 00:17:21.458
Or at least, that's how it looked.

00:17:24.169 --> 00:17:26.964
Now that they've lost me, their vessel,

00:17:27.214 --> 00:17:32.636
all of the evil spirits that I'd taken in
and controlled will be freed at once.

00:17:32.886 --> 00:17:35.973
Not even I can stop them anymore.

00:17:36.223 --> 00:17:38.934
--Shigeo!
--Dimple, go ahead and head back!

00:17:39.184 --> 00:17:40.644
I'll be fine!

00:17:40.894 --> 00:17:43.105
Y-You sure about that?!

00:18:02.833 --> 00:18:05.002
I'm going to save Asagiri-san.

00:18:05.252 --> 00:18:08.005
I'm going to completely exorcise
them before I leave.

00:18:08.255 --> 00:18:09.715
I'll be back, I promise.

00:18:09.965 --> 00:18:11.341
Don't worry.

00:18:15.512 --> 00:18:16.722
You trying to eat me, too?

00:18:16.972 --> 00:18:19.349
Damn it. Catch me if you can, you bastards!

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:20.809
Bring it!

00:18:22.728 --> 00:18:24.980
I'll be waiting for you on the other side!

00:18:30.277 --> 00:18:32.279
In this world,

00:18:32.529 --> 00:18:35.532
everything I can see is a spirit.

00:18:39.328 --> 00:18:41.622
I have to exorcise them all.

00:18:44.291 --> 00:18:46.335
No matter how much you struggle,

00:18:46.585 --> 00:18:48.920
your path will lead you to
the same place mine did...

00:18:49.171 --> 00:18:50.797
To ruin.

00:19:51.233 --> 00:19:54.778
I'm going to save her... I...

00:19:57.781 --> 00:19:59.616
I can't go out like this!

00:20:22.389 --> 00:20:24.182
I see.

00:20:24.433 --> 00:20:27.644
Your vessel has been shattered,

00:20:27.894 --> 00:20:30.021
and that's what is inside?

00:20:37.654 --> 00:20:39.614
I actually thought you might've died.

00:20:39.865 --> 00:20:41.408
That took you ages.

00:20:41.658 --> 00:20:43.326
Yes, a very long time...

00:20:43.577 --> 00:20:46.121
Master, how's Asagiri-san?

00:20:46.371 --> 00:20:49.082
Well, if you're awake...

00:20:51.334 --> 00:20:53.044
He's still--

00:20:53.295 --> 00:20:55.338
You've made your choice.

00:20:55.589 --> 00:20:59.593
I'll keep watching from afar to see
if you made the right one.

00:21:00.552 --> 00:21:03.346
You're not going anywhere, my pet.

00:21:03.597 --> 00:21:06.475
That was an unexpected trophy. Thank you.

00:21:06.725 --> 00:21:10.020
Isn't that... I didn't even
realize he was here.

00:21:10.270 --> 00:21:13.482
I'll make sure I take
really good care of him.

00:21:13.732 --> 00:21:16.318
Farewell. Perhaps we'll see each other again.

00:21:24.951 --> 00:21:26.995
Kageyama-kun?

00:21:27.245 --> 00:21:28.955
--Yeah.
--What?

00:21:29.206 --> 00:21:30.248
You guys know each other?

00:21:30.499 --> 00:21:34.169
Nah, she probably just remembers
what happened over there.

00:21:34.419 --> 00:21:38.256
Are you really always like that?

00:21:38.507 --> 00:21:40.717
Yeah... I am.

00:21:40.967 --> 00:21:42.302
I'm sorry.

00:21:52.020 --> 00:21:56.775
I'm really... really sorry...

00:21:57.025 --> 00:22:00.987
I'm so sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:22:01.238 --> 00:22:03.824
It's okay. I understand.

00:22:04.074 --> 00:22:05.575
Understand what?

00:22:05.826 --> 00:22:07.953
That people can change.

00:22:08.203 --> 00:22:11.122
Mogami-san and Asagiri-san
taught me that.

00:22:11.373 --> 00:22:14.376
The people around me changed me as well.

00:22:14.626 --> 00:22:19.005
Now I know that I might
be able to change others, too,

00:22:19.256 --> 00:22:22.342
so I'm glad we were able to meet.

00:22:25.762 --> 00:22:27.138
Thank you...

00:22:28.390 --> 00:22:32.769
So you're saying the one who
saved you is a boy in your grade?

00:22:33.019 --> 00:22:34.396
Yeah, why?

00:22:34.646 --> 00:22:37.649
There wasn't a middle school student
among the people I hired.

00:22:37.899 --> 00:22:38.900
Huh?

00:22:39.150 --> 00:22:40.777
He wasn't even asked to be there,

00:22:41.027 --> 00:22:44.239
but he managed to exorcise
an evil spirit that no one else could

00:22:44.489 --> 00:22:46.408
and left without saying a word.

00:22:46.658 --> 00:22:48.076
That's so cool.

00:22:48.326 --> 00:22:50.203
I hope I can see him again.

00:22:50.453 --> 00:22:54.833
I did a bit of research,
and this caught my eye.

00:22:54.833 --> 00:22:55.083
"Psycho Helmet Religion"” I did a bit
